      "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:17:30.205Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/fixundfertig123\">@fixundfertig123</a></p>\n<p>The custom solution may help as following;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>You can quote alternate item while composing quotation referencing source item;</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/e/8ea862c3a090bcd02fb0acdd69a242ca925adc20.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8ea862c3a090bcd02fb0acdd69a242ca925adc20\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/e/8ea862c3a090bcd02fb0acdd69a242ca925adc20_2_690x344.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"km0z4AO4znmt1FyMtNSqwZOuFAQ\" width=\"690\" height=\"344\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/e/8ea862c3a090bcd02fb0acdd69a242ca925adc20_2_690x344.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/e/8ea862c3a090bcd02fb0acdd69a242ca925adc20_2_1035x516.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/e/8ea862c3a090bcd02fb0acdd69a242ca925adc20_2_1380x688.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1767×881 70.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Alternate item table where quoted item serial number reference will make a connection in between two;</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0e93b6a6db7efb32d42d8cd8b44551102f1869a3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0e93b6a6db7efb32d42d8cd8b44551102f1869a3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e93b6a6db7efb32d42d8cd8b44551102f1869a3_2_690x256.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"24X9SdmfJIm4ki7pCpFEbGUhXlF\" width=\"690\" height=\"256\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e93b6a6db7efb32d42d8cd8b44551102f1869a3_2_690x256.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e93b6a6db7efb32d42d8cd8b44551102f1869a3_2_1035x384.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e93b6a6db7efb32d42d8cd8b44551102f1869a3_2_1380x512.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1725×640 56.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Finally the print will have better look;</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f8bbdaaf703934f6c643d9ea96624acc94b17350.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f8bbdaaf703934f6c643d9ea96624acc94b17350\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f8bbdaaf703934f6c643d9ea96624acc94b17350_2_690x487.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zuoT5tY1MKGG42jRcZn6LombzB6\" width=\"690\" height=\"487\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f8bbdaaf703934f6c643d9ea96624acc94b17350_2_690x487.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f8bbdaaf703934f6c643d9ea96624acc94b17350_2_1035x730.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f8bbdaaf703934f6c643d9ea96624acc94b17350.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F1EE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1250×884 55.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Eventually, storing data in Quotation doctype and printing them serve the purpose.</p>",
